Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 09:40:33 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是永遠不要和窮人做生意
Segment #2   [00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,760] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 因為窮生奸計 負擔良心
Segment #3   [00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,060] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 你跟有權人做生意
Segment #4   [00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,340] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 有權人不會去扣你
Segment #5   [00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,600] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 他不會去在你身上
Segment #6   [00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,960] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 想著如何我去算計你
Segment #7   [00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,920] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 10 | Text: 因為所有的生意他都有珠其性
Segment #8   [00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,280] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 不可能任何一個行業
Segment #9   [00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,240] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 他能去做一輩子
Segment #10  [00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,160] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 就像李嘉誠說的
Segment #11  [00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,860] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 永遠不賺最後一個等同版
Segment #12  [00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,000] | Elapsed:  16.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 在行業到瓶頸
Segment #13  [00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,820] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 無有泥的時候
Segment #14  [00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,560] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 合夥人之間
Segment #15  [00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,100] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 大家產生的一些想法
Segment #16  [00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,000] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 都想各回各家
Segment #17  [00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,640] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 各老各媽了
Segment #18  [00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,020] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 這個時候我可能會去散伙
Segment #19  [00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:23,940] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 老話不也說了嘛
Segment #20  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,460] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 天下沒有不散的演習
Segment #21  [00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,240] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 3  | Text: 也有可能
Segment #22  [00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,180] | Elapsed:  16.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 我開始在做一件事情之前
Segment #23  [00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,140] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 我所有的前期的預判
Segment #24  [00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,120] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 書記的調研
Segment #25  [00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,280] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 我感覺百分之百正確
Segment #26  [00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,440] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是真正我去做了以後
Segment #27  [00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,780] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 發現這個項目是虧損你
Segment #28  [00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:35,820] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 兩人也要散伙
Segment #29  [00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,400] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 2  | Text: 這個時候
Segment #30  [00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,820] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 7  | Text: 就考驗人品的時候了
Segment #31  [00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,240] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果說你和窮人做生意
Segment #32  [00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,160] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 窮人能扣死你
Segment #33  [00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,260] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 他精進技巧
Segment #34  [00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,680] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 比如說我還以煩煉為例
Segment #35  [00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,800] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 有可能他給你
Segment #36  [00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,360] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 4  | Text: 國外漂瓶
Segment #37  [00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,680] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 後出設備都給你賣了
Segment #38  [00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,860] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 捲錢他就跑了
Segment #39  [00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:47,980] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是你要和有權人
Segment #40  [00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,660] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 5  | Text: 做生意不一樣
Segment #41  [00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:49,620] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 有權人有格局
Segment #42  [00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,340] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 有權人懂得合作共有
Segment #43  [00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,800] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 7  | Text: 有權人在項目的
Segment #44  [00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,680] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 一定程度上會懂得讓利
Segment #45  [00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,840] | Elapsed:  36.92s | Words: 8  | Text: 我給大家再舉個例子
Segment #46  [00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,380] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 可能有一個更深入的了解
Segment #47  [00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,160] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 比如說
Segment #48  [00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,340] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 兩人沒共事過的時候
Segment #49  [00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:02,280] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 他們兩人去做了一件項目
Segment #50  [00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:04,540] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是前期我對於你的了解
Segment #51  [00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,700] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 我感覺你的能力
Segment #52  [00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,060] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 只百分之三十的分潤
Segment #53  [00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:08,720] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是當真正去做了以後
Segment #54  [00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:09,800] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 會發現
Segment #55  [00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,140] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 和伙人之間
Segment #56  [00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:13,220] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 11 | Text: 前期給彼此許的餅太大了
Segment #57  [00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:14,380] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 他去做之前
Segment #58  [00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:15,560] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 3  | Text: 承諾不了
Segment #59  [00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:15,960] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 比如說
Segment #60  [00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,880] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 我是一個店鋪的運營
Segment #61  [00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,020] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 我現在喊你做生意
Segment #62  [00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,240] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 我說我一天都給你補成
Segment #63  [00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:20,740] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 3  | Text: 三十桌
Segment #64  [00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:22,180] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 我有百分之三十的分潤
Segment #65  [00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,280] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 但真正做了以後
Segment #66  [00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:23,700] | Elapsed:  54.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 我發現
Segment #67  [00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,560] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 通過我的運營技巧
Segment #68  [00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,540] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 我一天只有十桌
Segment #69  [00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:27,480] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 那這個時候怎麼辦
Segment #70  [00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,880] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 我這百分之三十的分潤
Segment #71  [00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:29,940] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 5  | Text: 站在理性的
Segment #72  [00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:31,420] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 串一串的層面來講
Segment #73  [00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:32,780] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 我承諾的你的東西
Segment #74  [00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:33,800] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 我沒有做到
Segment #75  [00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,960] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 那你承諾我的分潤
Segment #76  [00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,760] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 是不是也要相對應的減少一些
Segment #77  [00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:37,880] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是很多人
Segment #78  [00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:38,500] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不懂得
Segment #79  [00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:40,180] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 自己主動讓分潤
Segment #80  [00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:40,800] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 1  | Text: 或者
Segment #81  [00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,460] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 5  | Text: 比如很多還有這種情況
Segment #82  [00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:43,480] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是比如說
Segment #83  [00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,660] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 我還是以這個飯店為例
Segment #84  [00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:46,960] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 我開始給你聊的
Segment #85  [00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,700] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 我能給你一天
Segment #86  [00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:48,820] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 帶來三十桌的客人
Segment #87  [00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:50,020] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 2  | Text: 但是發現
Segment #88  [00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:51,560] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 我一天能給你帶兩百桌
Segment #89  [00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,640] | Elapsed:  73.20s | Words: 6  | Text: 整個飯店離了
Segment #90  [00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,420] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以我不能活了
Segment #91  [00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:53,960] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 2  | Text: 這個時候
Segment #92  [00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:54,920] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人老闆會認為
Segment #93  [00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,540] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 2  | Text: 哎呀
Segment #94  [00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:56,600] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 我的功能很大
Segment #95  [00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,320] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 1  | Text: 這個
Segment #96  [00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,040] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 我把太吵好了就行了
Segment #97  [00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,180] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就給我帶三千桌
Segment #98  [00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:01,220] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 我不會給你多分錢
Segment #99  [00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:02,340] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 我這個就要格局問題
Segment #100 [00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:03,600] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 窮人就會這樣幹
Segment #101 [00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,720] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是用格局的人
Segment #102 [00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,720] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 他們會主動的
Segment #103 [00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,800] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 我給你多分一點
Segment #104 [00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,420] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 1  | Text: 沒有
Segment #105 [00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:09,120] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 你比如說你拿百分之三十
Segment #106 [00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,140] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 你出的力大了
Segment #107 [00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:10,460] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 1  | Text: 不行
Segment #108 [00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:11,440] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 我給你百分之四十
Segment #109 [00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:11,980] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 百分之五十
Segment #110 [00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:12,860] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 會多分一點
Segment #111 [00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:13,220] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以說
Segment #112 [00:02:13,220 --> 00:02:14,740] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 這就是兩者之間的
Segment #113 [00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:15,520] | Elapsed:  90.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 根據區別
Segment #114 [00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,140] | Elapsed:  90.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 你永遠不要和窮人
Segment #115 [00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:17,500] | Elapsed:  90.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 做生意
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
